# Ghostty exports TERM=xterm-ghostty. ncurses ships that terminal's
# capabilities under the name "ghostty" and no alias, so a fresh guest cannot
# start tmux, clear, less, or any other curses program under Ghostty. The
# alias is compiled from the ncurses entry rather than vendored so the
# capabilities stay whatever the installed ncurses says they are.
xterm-ghostty|Ghostty terminal emulator,
	use=ghostty,
